        {
          "text": "KU K'uei-kuang 顧奎光 (T. 星五), 1719–1764, official and scholar, was a native of Wu-hsi, Kiangsu. His great-grandfather, Ku Ch'ên 顧宸 (T. 修遠, chü-jên of 1639), was a bibliophile and a writer who left the following two works: 宋文選 Sung-wên hsüan, 30 chüan (1661), and 杜詩註解 Tu-shih chu-chieh, 12 + 7 chüan (1663).",
